# Sandbox credential-mask artifacts — 0-byte /dev/null character devices (owner
# "nobody") leaked into this directory by a sandboxed agent session on 2026-07-02.
# They contain nothing and are safe to delete manually; ignored here so they can
# never break `git add -A` again. Remove an entry if this repo ever gains a real
# file by one of these names (e.g. a repo-level .mcp.json).
# .claude/ currently holds only session-local state (settings.local.json,
# .cc-writes) and more of the same artifacts. Children are ignored individually
# (not the dir itself) so real content (e.g. skills/) can be re-included later
# with a `!` negation.
/.claude/*

/.bash_profile
/.bashrc
/.gitconfig
/.gitmodules
/.idea
/.mcp.json
/.profile
/.ripgreprc
/.vscode
/.zprofile
/.zshrc
